<title>ITALY: Italian and Spanish premiers to meet Sept 16-17.</title>
<headline>Italian and Spanish premiers to meet Sept 16-17.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Prime Minister Minister Romano Prodi will meet Spanish Prime Minister Jose Maria Aznar on September 16-17, Prodi's office said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The statement said the meeting would be held in the Spanish city of Valencia.</p>
</text>
